Z||000004||TRL46202||10-09-2000||10:51 AM||||Thanks guys! On more question, I do have 2 new tires on the rear of my original grey laced rims and would like to transfer them to the black laced ones. Are the grey laced rims all the same size? and which of the black laced wheels are the same size as the grey? I am going to buy 2 more new tires, so will I have to buy them in a larger width. Maybe someone can give the dimensions of tires that I should use on the black laced rims.....<P>thanks! Tom||||reg||1
Z||000005||SibERThuG||10-09-2000||12:00 PM||||I have an 88' with those honeycomb rims. The tires should be as follows...<P>Rear- 215/60/15<BR>Front- 205/60/15<P>However, I put Pirelli 225/50/15 on all the way around. It lowered the car about 1.5 - 2 inches and improved the handling unbelievably.<P>------------------<BR>Robbie<BR>88' Formula||||reg||4
